# Trivy ignore list for connector images — consumed by
# .github/workflows/scan-and-push.yml via the `trivyignores` input. The action
# fails the job if this file is missing, so keep it even while it is empty.
#
# Syntax: one vulnerability ID per line, optionally followed by an expiry and a
# reason.
#
#   CVE-2024-1234  # expires:2026-12-31 reason:alpine 3.20 base, fix lands in 3.21
#
# An entry without `expires:` never expires. Do not add any.
#
# Policy for this repo:
#   * Only findings inherited from a base image belong here. The connector
#     binary is built from ./sdk in this repo, so a finding that points at it is
#     ours to fix, never to ignore.
#   * CRITICAL is not ignorable. If a base image ships one, bump the tag in that
#     connector's Dockerfile.
#   * The one exception is a default gem that the base image's own runtime
#     shadows: present on disk, never loaded, and not removable by any package
#     operation. `gem uninstall` refuses default gems, and editing a gemspec's
#     version to quiet the scanner would hide a real vulnerability, so those get
#     a documented, expiring entry instead. Prove the shadowing before adding
#     one — see the json entry below.
#   * Every entry carries a reason and an expiry, and the author removes it when
#     the expiry passes.
#
# Adding an entry means the gate stops seeing that finding for every connector
# sharing the base image — keep the list short enough to review.

# json 2.18.0 is a default gem of the Ruby 4.0.0 that wpscanteam/wpscan:v4.1.0
# ships, so it is compiled into the interpreter and RubyGems refuses to
# uninstall it. The connector image installs json 2.21.1 alongside it, and
# RubyGems activates the higher version, so the flagged 2.18.0 is never loaded:
# `ruby -rjson -e 'puts JSON::VERSION'` prints 2.21.1 in the built image. Drop
# this entry once upstream ships a Ruby whose default json is >= 2.19.2, at which
# point the vulnerable copy is gone rather than shadowed.
CVE-2026-33210  # expires:2026-12-31 reason:shadowed ruby default gem, 2.21.1 is what loads
